      <activity id="d71e9de9-4275-57f6-9c77-14cb3f8c9535" activityNameId="fae57d8d-d04e-51ad-adf7-9c326b52b7be" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="2" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Latex, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Latex, at plant
Data are from the Eco-profiles of the European plastics industry (APME). Not included are the values reported for: recyclable wastes, amount of air / N2 / O2 consumed, unspecified metal emission to air and to water, mercaptan emission to air, unspecified CFC/HCFC emission to air. The amount of "sulphur (bonded)" is assumed to be included into the amount of raw oil.;
Synonyms: Styrene-butadiene dispersion; 
UUID: b242dd8f-393a-36a6-b974-436e78f905a2
Aggregated data for all processes from raw material extraction until delivery at plant
Location: 17 European plants (A, SF, F, D, I, NL, S, UK)
Technology: production by emulsion polymerization out of styrene and butadiene
Time period: time to which data refer
Production volume: 700 kt (1997)
Sampling: literature values based on company survey 
Extrapolations: no extrapolation
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_b242dd8f-393a-36a6-b974-436e78f905a2.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
